        [ [3],   [4],  [7],  [8]],
        [ [9],  [10], [13],  [14]],
        [ [11], [12], [15],  [16]]]]

  ```

  Args:
    input: A `Tensor`.
    block_size: An `int` that is `>= 2`.
      The size of the spatial block, same as in Space2Depth.
    data_format: An optional `string` from: `"NHWC", "NCHW", "NCHW_VECT_C"`. Defaults to `"NHWC"`.
